[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i11"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我来到了神社。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"忽然，我回想了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那还是我在学校里的往事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有段时间我们一直在讨论。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"约会的时候专门去趟神社，感觉很时尚，也很受女生欢迎。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"通过若无其事地展示神社的礼仪做法，然后教给对方，把自己装饰成出色的男性。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……稍微复习一下吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"首先是参道的走法。"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"走右边","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"走正中间","value":1,"condition":1},{"text":"走左边","value":2,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":20,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"参道的正中间，是神明通行的道路。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以，只要不走在正中间，应该都是没问题的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，既然手水舍是在右边的，还是走右边吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样应该就不至于在神明之前横穿而显得很失礼了。"},{"op":"add","variable":6031,"value":1},{"op":"goto","target":32},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":26,"value":["==",["v",6001],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了展现自己那不会动摇的内心。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又或者是，为了展现自己对神明大人表里如一的诚挚心灵。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我决定笔直地在参道的正中间走。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从某种意义上来说，这也是在和神明对话。"},{"op":"goto","target":32},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":32,"value":["==",["v",6001],2]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有一个词，叫做旁门左道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这个词是指偏移了人间正道，和邪道意思差不多。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在神明面前，所有人都是那种左道的存在吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了告诫自己这一点，我在左侧行走。"},{"op":"goto","target":32},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，我来到了手水舍前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这里我应该清洗自己的……”"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"脸和牙齿","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"脚和罪孽","value":1,"condition":1},{"text":"手和嘴","value":2,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":44,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“与神明会面的礼仪非常重要。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我用力地清洗着自己的脸。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没有牙刷……不过我在口中含了口水，用手指刷洗着牙齿。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“过去的人，应该是这样做的吧……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咕噜咕噜……呸。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呼……”"},{"op":"set","variable":7127,"value":1},{"op":"goto","target":73},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":54,"value":["==",["v",6001],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“虽说是洗脚，但也并非是放弃罪孽的意思。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好像是，承认罪孽的同时，把水泼在脚上吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好像叫……洗礼来着？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……咦？这好像是别的宗教吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"无所谓了，反正日本是多神教的，应该没什么问题吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"重要的是这份心意。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把水不断地泼在脚上。"},{"op":"set","variable":7127,"value":2},{"op":"goto","target":73},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":73,"value":["==",["v",6001],2]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"过去人们在来到神明面前之前，都要先用水清洗身体。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"将这个步骤简化以后，就是所谓的洗手礼仪了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“首先，先用右手握住柄杓，从出水口处接水”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后用接来的水去清洗左手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接下来，再用左手拿住柄杓，清洗右手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"之后，再用右手拿住柄杓，用左手接水，并将水送入口中漱口。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咕噜咕噜……呸。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"最后，再把柄杓直立起来，清洗柄的部分。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"沾湿的手，则是让其自然晾干。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这就是正确的洗手礼顺序了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"记住这套礼仪作法……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也是想有朝一日和女孩子一起来的时候，能让她对我刮目相看。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然，从没派上过用场。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉有点难过。"},{"op":"add","variable":6031,"value":1},{"op":"set","variable":7127,"value":3},{"op":"goto","target":73},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"摇动树叶的微风，轻抚着我被水沾湿的皮肤。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉神清气爽。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嗯，我做好了站在神明大人面前的准备。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"站到了赛钱箱前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"手里已经握好了100日元硬币。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我要把这份香火钱……"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"用饱含心意的正投法投进去","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"用开天辟地般的侧投法投进去","value":1,"condition":1},{"text":"用轻柔优雅的下投法投进去","value":2,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":89,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“请实现我的愿望吧!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我集中全身的力气，将手中的零钱投入了赛钱箱。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咣当！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"硬币击中了木框，朝着完全不同的方向飞了出去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我灰溜溜地捡起了掉在地上的硬币，用下投将其重新投入了赛钱箱。"},{"op":"add","variable":10012,"value":100},{"op":"goto","target":107},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":98,"value":["==",["v",6001],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“天地之间的夹缝，即为彰显人类的投法！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我满怀万千思绪，将手中的零钱向赛钱箱投了进去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咻――……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"硬币击中了木框，朝着完全不同的方向飞了出去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我灰溜溜地捡起了掉在地上的硬币，用下投将其重新投入了赛钱箱。"},{"op":"add","variable":10012,"value":100},{"op":"goto","target":107},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":107,"value":["==",["v",6001],2]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“以此敬奉予神。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我轻轻地从下方将硬币投入了赛钱箱。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"叮当。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"抛出去的硬币和赛钱箱中的硬币相互碰撞，令人心情舒畅。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我感受到了岛上虔诚的信仰。"},{"op":"add","variable":10012,"value":100},{"op":"add","variable":6031,"value":1},{"op":"goto","target":107},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"最后，是祈愿的做法。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"剩下的，就只有拍手和行礼了……"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"二礼二拍一礼","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"二拍二礼一拍","value":1,"condition":1},{"text":"二拍二拍一拍","value":2,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":132,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我郑重地鞠了两次躬。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，用力地拍了两次手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"再鞠躬一次。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，进行祈愿。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总而言之……"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"祝愿我能度过一个快乐的暑假。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…………"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i11"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我抬起头，睁开眼睛。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"退后一步，轻轻颔首。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这就是正确的参拜做法。"},{"op":"add","variable":6031,"value":1},{"op":"set","variable":7128,"value":1},{"op":"goto","target":166},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":155,"value":["==",["v",6001],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"首先，先拍两次手告知神明“我来了”。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啪啪"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，再低头鞠两次躬。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"祝愿我能度过一个快乐的暑假。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…………"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i11"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我抬起头，睁开眼睛。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在这时要再拍一次手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啪"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是为了告知神明“我要回去了”。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…………"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样就好了吗……？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉有点不安。"},{"op":"set","variable":7128,"value":2},{"op":"goto","target":166},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":166,"value":["==",["v",6001],2]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"首先，先拍两次手，告知神明“我来了”。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啪啪"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，再拍两次手，像神明表明我就在于此。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啪啪"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"您听到了吗？再拍一次手向神明确认。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啪"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咦？那许愿应该是在什么时候？"},{"op":"set","variable":7128,"value":3},{"op":"goto","target":166},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“总之，参拜结束。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"最重要的，还是来参拜神明的这份心意。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只要有这份心意，礼仪作法有些偏差神明应该也会原谅我的吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我离开了神社。"},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":1},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":173,"value":["==",["v",6031],4]},{"op":"goto","target":173},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]